#: Game/Doc.lean:42
msgid "§0 — the **anonymous constructor**: builds a value of the goal's\n"
"structure-like type without naming its constructor.\n"
"\n"
"Its gentle form is a number witness: on the goal §1,\n"
"§2 supplies the §3 and leaves §4 open. The\n"
"components flatten through a chain of §5/§6 in one stroke —\n"
"§7 opens a two-part claim about one witness — and each\n"
"component can be a term, a §8 hole for §9 to leave open, or a\n"
"tactic block (§10).\n"
"\n"
"It calls back later in two costumes: the fuel donation §11\n"
"(every §12 statement *is* an existential — “**some** fuel finishes the\n"
"run”), and a loop's §13 goal, which asks you to package final values\n"
"with the facts about them, e.g. §14."
msgstr ""

