#: Game/Doc.lean:58
msgid "§0 — the *and-then-on-every-goal* combinator: run §1,\n"
"then run §2 on **every** goal it produced (a plain newline sequence\n"
"would aim §3 at the first goal only).\n"
"\n"
"First use: after §4 leaves one goal per program,\n"
"§5 sweeps them all in one stroke. Later, the house one-breath\n"
"idiom chains whole stages:\n"
"§6 —\n"
"split, split again on *both* results (four cases), execute all four\n"
"symbolically, sweep all four with arithmetic. Chains act stage by stage:\n"
"each §7 applies its right-hand tactic to all goals the stage before it\n"
"left."
msgstr ""

