#: Game/Doc.lean:72
msgid "§0 closes total-correctness goals (§1,\n"
"§2) for straight-line *and single-branching* loop-free bodies.\n"
"\n"
"It commits a fuel witness, symbolically executes the interpreter with\n"
"§3 (pass the loaded program constant, e.g. §4), and\n"
"discharges the residual value equations with §5/§6. If a symbolic\n"
"§7 survives as an §8, it §9s the branches and finishes each side\n"
"with §10.\n"
"\n"
"Its limit is honest: *two sequential* §11s produce a shape its single-§12\n"
"recipe cannot attack — that is the boss level of Straight-Line World. And it\n"
"fails *curated*: when a body leaves interpreter state unresolved (a mangled\n"
"second §13, a §14 loop), the error is a one-paragraph pointer toward\n"
"§15 and the manual §16 route — never a dump of raw interpreter\n"
"internals."
msgstr ""

