#: Game/Doc.lean:89
msgid "§0 closes a standard corollary of an already\n"
"proved total-correctness theorem §1 — *without re-executing the program*.\n"
"\n"
"It handles the gallery corollary shapes, in particular a value-rewritten\n"
"§2 restatement: §3 where §4 is propositionally (not\n"
"definitionally) equal to §5's value. Side hypotheses of §6 (like\n"
"§7) are discharged by §8; when plain unification cannot bridge\n"
"the two value forms, it normalizes with the §9 as rewrite rules — e.g.\n"
"§10."
msgstr ""

