"antecedent into the context as a hypothesis §3, leaving §4 to prove.\n"
"\n"
"The move that opens every *negation* proof: §5 in Lean **is** the\n"
"implication §6, so on a goal §7, §8 hands you §9 and\n"
"the goal §10 — assume the impossible thing, then demolish it."
