#: Game/Doc.lean:126
msgid "§0 is core Lean's general-purpose finisher: congruence closure plus\n"
"e-matching plus integer arithmetic over your hypotheses.\n"
"\n"
"Why not §1? Two reasons that recur in this game. First, comparisons\n"
"*stated over the §2 brand* — a statement binder's §3, a §4\n"
"split, a §5 goal of your own — elaborate brand-headed, and §6\n"
"skips anything whose head type is the brand; §7 matches up to reducible\n"
"unfolding, so it sees through. Second, §8 is strictly *linear*: a\n"
"product of two variables like §9 is out of its language, while §10\n"
"happily treats it as an atom and reasons around it.\n"
"\n"
"You can also hand it ammunition in brackets:\n"
"§11 adds the named theorems\n"
"to its matching pool for this one call — the house way to say *finish,\n"
"using these facts*."
msgstr ""

