#: Game/Doc.lean:272
msgid "§0 — the **result-binding arrow**: exactly the same judgment\n"
"as §1, written in *hypothesis position*. A hypothesis\n"
"§2 reads: “the call terminated, and §3 names\n"
"whatever it returned.” Because both arrows target the same judgment, the\n"
"goal view renders §4 as §5 — the meaning is identical; only the role\n"
"differs: §6 *states* what a run returns, §7 *binds* it so your theorem\n"
"can talk about the result without naming a formula for it.\n"
"\n"
"Pair it with determinism (§8) to replace the bound name\n"
"by a value you have proved."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `CallsTo.typed_int_eq : f(…) ⇓ r → f(…) ==> e → r = e`
