"so it needs an **§20 clause** — a fact true at *either* door. No need\n"
"to memorize this: call §21 **bare** and the walker\n"
"requests everything it needs, §22 included.\n"
"\n"
"A trick question waits in the outer loop: when §23 is even, how many laps\n"
"actually run?"
msgstr ""

